# --- Library binaries ---
# The books live in Cloudflare R2, not in git. A 1.5 GB repository broke the
# Vercel build container (ENOSPC) and the files could never be served from a
# serverless function anyway. Only the metadata is versioned.
# Upload with: pnpm library:upload
library/**/*.pdf
library/**/*.epub
library/**/cover.webp
library/**/cover.jpg
